<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro will automatically collect from and feed fresh books to 15 laborers in a guild hall, depositing the loot at the end of the run.. Guild hall must be set up exactly like this in the comment, and you must have books in the first slot of your bank inventory. You must have a second bank tab configured to accept your loot. Start the macro as soon as you load onto the island. You must be dismounted and have enough carry weight for the entire process without being overloaded.</Description>
    <Comment>https://imgur.com/a/oN6BdJV</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
